<section id="math">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-mark">&infin; &mdash; math &amp; other curiosities</span>
    <h2>Math &amp; Curiosities</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="section-desc">Half-finished proofs, things I find beautiful, and the slow work of a mathematician-in-training. Not a lecture. A sketchbook.</p>

  <div class="card-row two-col">
    <Card>
      <h3>Mathematics for Poets</h3>
      <p>A big mathematical idea, opened with a poem that already knew it. Quarterly, unhurried, in progress.</p>
      <span class="tag">ongoing &mdash; current focus</span>
    </Card>
    <Card>
      <h3>Reading log</h3>
      <p>Notes from Wolf's <em>Proof, Logic, and Conjecture</em>, and whatever comes after it, in the years before Hagen.</p>
      <span class="tag">rebuilding &mdash; 2026&ndash;2029</span>
    </Card>
  </div>
</section>
